#! Field and world systems (pass s3): the Crucible Isle arena (N38) and the sunken places of the sea floor (UNDERSEA).
#! N38 is reached by the sky cable from the Ninefold Shrine (CABLE_CHOIR, after CH07) and by airship after the fault.
#! N38_R01 Sky Dock: the cable house on the west rim, the airship field east, the road north to the Hall of Wagers.
